---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Jakob Kielland" gap>
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">Hi, I'm Jakob! 👋</h1>
  <p class="max-w-prose">
    I'm a developer who has a unique talent for getting really interested in
    niche things (ask me about my pokemon spreadsheet or wine certification). I
    enjoy all parts of the stack, but am partial to the frontend, and I am
    apparently unusually interested in CSS. I currently work as a developer at
    Norwegian Air Shuttle.
  </p>
  <p class="max-w-prose">
    Besides computers, I have a passion for travelling and teaching. I often get
    to combine these interests when speaking at conferences.
  </p>
  <p class="max-w-prose">
    This page is a place for me to collect the things I've wanted to put on the
    internet, be they stories of pranks from my high school years, game guides
    or my blog. Everything on this website (both code and prose) is written
    entirely by human hands. Enjoy your stay! 🚀
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
